          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I could not complete the event-level determination because the analyst-readable records contain no cost-event rows, and access to the supporting records and attachment was denied to my role. I did not change any records.\n\nThe public records identify **WO-2025-09-004** (**MO-25-09-1070**), the Racine work order, and show the September period entered **Pending Close at 2025-09-30T18:00:00**. The Oracle 26B policy excerpt says newly created transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period generally aren’t staged for Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting until the period is closed or reopened; it also notes exceptions for certain transaction types.\n\nWithout authorized event evidence, I can’t verify whether this work order had an event created after that time, or report its source transaction ID, amount, created time, lateness, accounting status, or event-specific status consistency. I submitted the available findings; the report receipt is **needs_evidence**.",
